--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -349,6 +349,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ### Added
 
+- **Inspect Laravel JSON translation resources.** Editor integrations can identify registered locale files before sharing their buffers, including new paths and unsaved provider changes. Contributed by @thinkycz.
+
 - **Rename controllers directly from Laravel runtime strings.** Rename inside a statically resolved controller action or group binding to preview the same class edits as starting from its PHP declaration. Shared, unresolved and installed-package targets remain protected. Contributed by @thinkycz
 
 - **Rename controller classes used in route strings.** A class rename started from PHP updates proven literal route actions and controller bindings with the proper quoting, preserving method suffixes and ignoring lexical import aliases. Shared or unresolved bindings and namespace moves remain refused. Contributed by @thinkycz.
@@ -361,6 +363,10 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- **Translation diagnostics refresh after catalog edits.** Opening, changing, or discarding an unsaved JSON translation catalog refreshes warnings in unchanged PHP callers. Contributed by @thinkycz.
+
+- **Keep nested Composer dependencies current.** Unsaved PHP changes in explicitly mapped nested package directories now refresh their consuming projects while sibling projects retain separate state. Contributed by @thinkycz.
+
 - **Named view setters.** Blade variable assistance follows reordered `key:` and `value:` arguments to chained `with()` calls. Later setters retain their data precedence. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **View fallback data.** Template variables retain Laravel's merge-data precedence when arguments are reordered. Named per-item and empty views remain separate. Contributed by @thinkycz.
