@@ -194,3 +194,48 @@ lsp.add_server {
 ```
 
 For AI coding agent setup, see [Agent Setup](agent-setup.md).
+
+## OpenStorm client extensions
+
+### JSON translation resources
+
+OpenStorm's downstream engine advertises
+`experimental.phpWorkbenchJsonTranslationResource` for a content-free registration
+query. Before sending a JSON locale buffer, call
+`phpWorkbench/jsonTranslationResource` with an existing PHP document or Composer
+manifest from the consuming Laravel project. A package's own Composer manifest
+need not select that consuming project.
+
+For a translation directory statically registered by an active provider:
+
+```json
+{
+  "projectUri": "file:///project/composer.json",
+  "resourceUri": "file:///project/packages/shop/translations/fr.json"
+}
+```
+
+The response echoes both selectors and identifies the registered directory:
+
+```json
+{
+  "projectUri": "file:///project/composer.json",
+  "resourceUri": "file:///project/packages/shop/translations/fr.json",
+  "rootUri": "file:///project/packages/shop/translations/"
+}
+```
+
+`rootUri` is null when the proposed file is not a statically registered JSON
+locale resource. Use preferred physical file URIs; the locale file and its parent
+directories may be new. The request contains no file text. Invalid authorities,
+non-JSON paths, aliases and non-file targets are refused.
+
+Keep the selected project, document revisions and server generation current while
+awaiting the response. Recheck after provider, project or configuration changes
+and server restart before forwarding more content. Missing capability, null,
+failed or stale responses do not admit the buffer. The query reports static
+registration information; client buffer forwarding is a separate integration.
+
+PSR-4 source directories explicitly mapped inside a nested Composer project
+remain dependencies of the consuming application. Their unsaved PHP provider
+changes refresh its registration decisions without merging sibling projects.
